entpier/torrentpier/pull/629\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#629</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/Exileum\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">Exileum</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added missing comments into Env class <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/633\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#633</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Apply fixes from StyleCI <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/634\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#634</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/635\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#635</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/Exileum\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">Exileum</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added missing comments Emailer <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/637\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#637</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Various fixes after composer deps update <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/638\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#638</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Fixed undefined value() functions <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/640\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#640</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added IPHelper implementation <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/631\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#631</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Fixing the .env load <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/643\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#643</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/Exileum\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">Exileum</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added Http class implementation <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/632\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#632</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Refactored Validate class <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/646\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#646</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added system check requirements and more <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/645\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#645</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Removed use